# entry-size

The size of a task entry, and of a slab slot holding one, before and after c4fe22d. `TaskEntry` and
`Slot` are private, so `run.sh` copies the tree at da655cf and at c4fe22d to a temp dir, adds a test
that prints both sizes, and runs it.

    proofs/entry-size/run.sh

On aarch64-apple-darwin:

    da655cf: TaskEntry 144 bytes, slab slot 152 bytes
    c4fe22d: TaskEntry 136 bytes, slab slot 144 bytes
